"definitions": {"phase":"Frozen audio_cost begin/end TSC; idle uses BSP first/last clock ns/TSC. Rates normalize to elapsed 10 ms, not IRQ or period counts.","clock_calibration":"TSC Hz = CPU0 (last_tsc-first_tsc)/(last_ns-first_ns). Same virtual clock calibrates per-CPU stage timing.","timing":"Only IF=0 regions tabulated. Nested regions overlap; sums are not exclusive CPU accounting. TSC elapsed includes guest execution, VM exits/emulation and host descheduling. Probe overhead included.","wakes":"A notification detached a registered non-null waiter and called task_wait_wake; waiter may already have timed out. Not unique parked-to-runnable transitions or scheduler dispatches.","hda_reads":"hda_mmio wrapper calls count MMIO reads only; writes are not counted.","hpet_reads":"Physical volatile HPET counter reads, including high/low/high and retry reads; counts per CPU.","mix_inner":"One timed source accumulation loop per valid session per mixed period; mix covers all sessions, output and readiness notification.","queue_copy":"Accepted request PCM to session ring only; stage_copy is caller PCM to typed request, including attempts that become WOULD_BLOCK; prepare_request is typed request setup/zeroing.","clock_categories":"Direct return PC resolved offline using matching ELF. Shared task_deadline_after_ms/task_deadline_expired PCs can serve several workers and are kept separate. Timers group contains arch_timer_arm, arch_timer_interrupt, sleep_wait, task_timer_interrupt and kernel_task_sleep_until. Readiness includes BSP local or network readiness scans; do not assign all to audio.","host_cpu":"/proc task stat deltas / CLK_TCK / actual monotonic window. utime includes guest_time. guest CPU0=guest_time; CPU0 host-side=utime+stime-guest_time. Host-side may include MMIO exit/audio/HPET emulation and kernel exit handling; it is not pure audio emulation.","strict_timer_group":"Direct arch_timer_arm and task_timer_interrupt return PCs only; task_timer_interrupt contains expire_timed_waits and wake_sleepers. Broader category includes sleep/check helpers that may span workers.","eight_1_inspection":"Counters froze on first producer stop; subsequent GDB inspection while seven producers remained active is excluded from engine qualification."},
